        "id": 1020677
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-08T17:16:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the concrete implementation of the broker is already loaded then `onBrokerApiStarted` will only be called in this `start` method (as `isBrokerApiStarted` will be true).\n\nIf, as it should be, the concrete implementation hasn\u0027t loaded yet, then `onBrokerApiStarted` will only be called in the listener `BrokerApiPluginListener`. \n\nI don\u0027t see how this could be called twice for the exact same instance of the same plugin?",
      "parentUuid": "a26c3879_5ca0fbc4",
