      "writtenOn": "2026-09-09T08:25:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e That\u0027s an interesting point: what happens if we start, stop and then start an \n\u003e events-broker implementation again? Do we receive the same messages twice? I \n\u003e don\u0027t believe we should because we are using the same group IDs.\n\nExactly, same group id, so we don\u0027t reconsume the messages.\n\n\u003e +1. I think this should be idempotent.\n\nAs per previous comment, I don\u0027t see how we risk connecting to the same broker twice?",
      "parentUuid": "d631af2e_f68b3e04",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 82,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 82,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "ead363356322245c4bd8c99c6e10287ddbdb3f65",
